.el .ds Aq '
.TH dslite-b4-check-config 8  "check-config "
.SH NAME
dslite\-b4\-check\-config \- Validate configuration without changing network state
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdslite\-b4 check\-config\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-source\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate configuration without changing network state
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR [default: /etc/dslite\-b4.toml]
Read configuration from this path
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-source\fR
Include the original TOML diagnostic. It may expose sensitive configuration values
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
